    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Defense and offense are not opposites. They are partners. Today they take the same step.</em></p><p><strong>The Third Door — 1/scene (recovers on Soma Break).</strong> As part of any single action on your turn, you may make <strong>one defensive and one offensive Surge spend together</strong>. Pay both costs; they do not compete for the same action-economy slot.</p><p>Example: Erupt into a target and Absorb its counterattack, both inside a single Strike.</p>",
